          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adam and his wife had another son. She said, “God has given me a son to replace Abel, whom Cain killed.” So she named him Seth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
