          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seth had a son whom he named Enosh. It was then that people began using the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
